  "ja301:2.1": "kaliṅgānamasayhasāhinaṁ → kaliṅgānaṁ asayhasāhinaṁ (bj); kāliṅgānaṁ asayhasāhinaṁ (sya-all)",
  "ja301:2.2": "anayo → ajayo (sya-all)",
  "ja301:2.3": "brahmacāri → brahmacārī (bj) | icceva → iccevaṁ (sya-all)",
  "ja301:2.4": "ujjubhūtā → ujajubhūtā (bj); ujubhūtā (sya-all)",
  "ja301:3.2": "dhanaṁ → tathaṁ (sya-all) | tesu → karaṁ nu (sya-all)",
